# language: en

Feature: Subscribe

    Scenario Outline: HeadlessApp_Subscribe_Sensor_Value
        Given PAL set sensor signal <path> to <datatype> <value>
        Given HeadlessApp subscribe the sensor signal <path> of <datatype>
        Then PAL set the signal at <path> of <datatype> to <values> by order, subscribe stream receive the same data
        And HeadlessApp unsubscribe the sensor signal <path> of <datatype> to close connections

    Examples:
        | path                                         | datatype  | value            | values            |
        | Vehicle.Acceleration | complex | {"Longitudinal":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Lateral":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Vertical":{"type":"float","value":0.0}} | ["{\"Longitudinal\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":3.4028235e+38},\"Lateral\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":3.4028235e+38},\"Vertical\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":3.4028235e+38}}","{\"Longitudinal\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":0.0},\"Lateral\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":0.0},\"Vertical\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":0.0}}","{\"Longitudinal\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":-3.4028235e+38},\"Lateral\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":-3.4028235e+38},\"Vertical\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":-3.4028235e+38}}"] |
        | Vehicle.AngularVelocity | complex | {"Roll":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Pitch":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Yaw":{"type":"float","value":0.0}} | ["{\"Roll\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":3.4028235e+38},\"Pitch\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":3.4028235e+38},\"Yaw\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":3.4028235e+38}}","{\"Roll\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":0.0},\"Pitch\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":0.0},\"Yaw\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":0.0}}","{\"Roll\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":-3.4028235e+38},\"Pitch\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":-3.4028235e+38},\"Yaw\":{\"type\":\"float\",\"value\":-3.4028235e+38}}"] |
        | Vehicle.AverageSpeed | float | 0.0 | ["3.4028235e+38","0.0","-3.4028235e+38"] |
        | Vehicle.CurrentOverallWeight | uint16 | 32767 | ["65535","32767","0"] |
        | Vehicle.IsAutoPowerOptimize | bool | false | ["true","false"] |
        | Vehicle.LowVoltageSystemState | string | LOCK | ["UNKNOWN","LOCK","OFF"] |
        | Vehicle.PowerOptimizeLevel | uint8 | 5 | ["10","5","0"] |
        | Vehicle.TraveledDistance | uint32 | 2147483647 | ["4294967295","2147483647","0"] |
        
    Scenario Outline: Notification of subscribed signals
        Given a signal at <path> is set to <value_0> of datatype <datatype>
        And attempts to subscribe the signal at <path> of datatype <datatype> is succeeded
        When the value of signal at <path> changes to <value_1> of datatype <datatype>
        Then the subscribe stream returns <datatype> <value_1> on <path>
        And HeadlessApp unsubscribe the sensor signal <path> of <datatype> to close connections

    Examples:
        | path                                                     | datatype      | value_0       | value_1       |
        | Vehicle.Acceleration | complex | {"Longitudinal":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Lateral":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Vertical":{"type":"float","value":0.0}} | {"Longitudinal":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38},"Lateral":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38},"Vertical":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38}} |
        | Vehicle.AngularVelocity | complex | {"Roll":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Pitch":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Yaw":{"type":"float","value":0.0}} | {"Roll":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38},"Pitch":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38},"Yaw":{"type":"float","value":3.4028235e+38}} |
        | Vehicle.AverageSpeed | float | 0.0 | 3.4028235e+38 |
        | Vehicle.CurrentOverallWeight | uint16 | 32767 | 65535 |
        | Vehicle.IsAutoPowerOptimize | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.LowVoltageSystemState | string | LOCK | UNKNOWN |
        | Vehicle.PowerOptimizeLevel | uint8 | 5 | 10 |
        | Vehicle.TraveledDistance | uint32 | 2147483647 | 4294967295 |
        
